 r←Test_IE_005(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;ref;parms;msg;n1;n2;testNo
⍝ Test IE with a local page that carries an "external" link. We need the user to click this link and judge whether it all worked.
⍝ The page should not change. The URL should be displayed with the default browser.
⍝ It would be really nice if we could automate this fully (SendKeys?!)
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 :If batchFlag
     r←¯1
 :Else

     parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.CreateParms
     testNo←¯3↑↑⎕XSI
     parms.caption←'IE Test Case Number "',testNo,'"'
     n1←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.Create parms

     #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
     'Temp'#.⎕NS''
     #.Temp.html1←⊂'<h1>Test number ',testNo,'</h1>'
     #.Temp.html1,←⊂'<p>External <a href="http://aplwiki.com/">link to the APL wiki</a></p>'
     #.Temp.html1,←⊂'<p><b>Please perform the following action:</b></p>'
     #.Temp.html1,←⊂'<p>Click on the external link pointing to the APL wiki and <b>then</b> close the form.</p>'
     #.Temp.html1,←⊂'<p>The link to the APL wiki should open in your default browser while this page remain unchanged.'
     #.Temp.⎕FX'{r}←OnClose msg' '(⎕IO ⎕ML)←1 3' 'r←1' 'self←↑msg' 'n←self.n' '∆HTML←n.IEobject.Document.documentElement.outerHTML~⎕TC'

     n1.∆Form.onClose←'#.Temp.OnClose'

     parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.IE.CreateParms
     parms.onNavigate←'#.Temp.OnNavigate'
     n2←parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.IE.CreateIE n1.∆Form

     #.APLGUI.APLGUI.IE.ShowHtml n2.IEobject #.Temp.html1
     ⎕DL 0.25

     ⎕DQ n1.∆Form
     ∆Process n1.∆Form

     →PassesIf 1 ∆PromptForSuccess'Did the Browser control act in the expected way?'

     r←∆OK

 :EndIf

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 0 ⋄ n1.∆container.Close ⋄ :EndTrap
 :Trap 0 ⋄ ##.FilesAndDirs.DeleteFile n2.∆container.IEobject.∆Filename ⋄ :EndTrap
⍝Done
